WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:09.577
Karibu WODDI Institute. Mwongozo huu mfupi unakuonyesha jinsi ya kutumia programu, hatua kwa hatua.

2
00:00:09.577 --> 00:00:17.846
WODDI Institute ni mafunzo ya bure kwa wanawake kote Afrika: ujuzi wa vitendo, washauri na vyeti, kwenye simu yako.

3
00:00:18.396 --> 00:00:26.873
Kwanza, chagua lugha yako. Iguse juu ya ukurasa. Programu inabadilika kuwa lugha yako.

4
00:00:27.423 --> 00:00:30.680
Ili kujiunga, gusa kitufe cha kuanza.

5
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.050
Andika jina lako kamili.

6
00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:40.672
Unaweza kujisajili kwa barua pepe au kwa namba yako ya simu. Hapa tunatumia namba ya simu.

7
00:00:40.672 --> 00:00:44.499
Chagua nchi yako, kisha chagua mtandao wako.

8
00:00:44.499 --> 00:00:50.617
Weka nenosiri lenye herufi au namba sita au zaidi, kisha gusa Fungua akaunti.

9
00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:56.457
Akaunti yako iko tayari. Gusa kitufe kufungua dashibodi yako.

10
00:00:57.007 --> 00:00:59.655
Wakati ujao, gusa Ingia.

11
00:00:59.655 --> 00:01:07.952
Weka namba ile ile ya simu au barua pepe, na nenosiri lako. Unaweza pia kugusa Endelea na Google.

12
00:01:07.952 --> 00:01:13.634
Ukisahau nenosiri lako, gusa Umesahau nenosiri, nasi tutakusaidia.

13
00:01:14.184 --> 00:01:21.488
Huu ndio ukurasa wako wa mwanzo. Kadi kubwa inaonyesha hatua yako inayofuata kila wakati.

14
00:01:21.488 --> 00:01:29.159
Menyu iliyo chini inakupeleka kila mahali: mwanzo, masomo, jumuiya, mshauri, wasifu wako na zaidi.

15
00:01:29.709 --> 00:01:39.030
Kila mtu anaanza na Rooting, hatua ya mizizi: moduli nane fupi kuhusu WODDI na safari yako. Gusa kitufe cha kuanza.

16
00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.230
Fungua moduli ya kwanza.

17
00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:43.631
Soma somo hadi mwisho.

18
00:01:43.631 --> 00:01:53.116
Jibu swali fupi, kisha gusa Wasilisha na ukamilishe. Moduli inayofuata inafunguka. Maliza zote nane.

19
00:01:53.666 --> 00:01:59.815
Ukimaliza Rooting, Blueprint inafunguka. Gusa kadi ya Blueprint.

20
00:01:59.815 --> 00:02:09.302
Blueprint ina nguzo tatu: Utambulisho, Wito, na Ushawishi na Urithi. Zikamilishe kwa mpangilio, kwa njia ile ile.

21
00:02:09.852 --> 00:02:18.812
Baada ya Blueprint, Kituo cha Kozi kinafunguka, chenye kozi zaidi ya mia moja. Gusa alama ya masomo, chini.

22
00:02:18.812 --> 00:02:22.795
Gusa Tazama kozi, na uchague kozi unayoipenda.

23
00:02:22.795 --> 00:02:28.524
Ukurasa wa kozi unaonyesha utakachojifunza. Gusa Anza kozi.

24
00:02:28.524 --> 00:02:34.064
Soma kila somo, au gusa kitufe cha vipokea sauti ili kulisikiliza.

25
00:02:34.064 --> 00:02:42.778
Gusa Endelea ili kusonga mbele. Kila moduli inaishia na jaribio fupi, na kozi inaishia na jaribio la mwisho.

26
00:02:43.328 --> 00:02:49.977
Ukifaulu jaribio la mwisho, unapata cheti. Ili kukiona, gusa Zaidi.

27
00:02:49.977 --> 00:02:51.921
Kisha gusa Vyeti.

28
00:02:51.921 --> 00:02:54.319
Gusa Tazama na pakua.

29
00:02:54.319 --> 00:03:04.294
Gusa Pakua PDF, au PNG kupata picha. Mtu yeyote anaweza kuthibitisha cheti chako mtandaoni kwa msimbo wake.

30
00:03:04.844 --> 00:03:12.921
Cheti chako pia kinafungua eneo lako la wahitimu. Kwenye ukurasa wa mwanzo, gusa Jumuiya ya wahitimu.

31
00:03:12.921 --> 00:03:23.003
Shiriki mafanikio, uliza swali au toa msaada. Andika ujumbe wako na ugusa Chapisha.

32
00:03:23.003 --> 00:03:29.776
Hapa unaweza pia kujiunga na vikundi, kukutana na wahitimu wengine, na kupata fursa na matukio.

33
00:03:30.326 --> 00:03:35.140
Ili kuuza bidhaa au ujuzi, gusa Duka langu la Marketplace.

34
00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:39.923
Gusa Tangazo jipya, kisha chagua bidhaa, huduma au ujuzi.

35
00:03:39.923 --> 00:03:46.159
Lipe jina lililo wazi na uchague aina.

36
00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:59.113
Lieleze na uweke bei yako.

37
00:03:59.113 --> 00:04:07.089
Ongeza namba yako ya WhatsApp na ugusa Chapisha tangazo. Wanunuzi wanawasiliana nawe moja kwa moja.

38
00:04:07.639 --> 00:04:12.590
Unahitaji msaada wakati wowote? Gusa Mshauri.

39
00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:21.687
Andika swali lako na ugusa tuma. Mshauri wako anajibu kwa lugha yako.

40
00:04:21.687 --> 00:04:25.684
Unaweza pia kugusa kipaza sauti na kuzungumza.

41
00:04:25.684 --> 00:04:30.039
Ili kuanza mazungumzo mapya, gusa Futa mazungumzo.

42
00:04:30.589 --> 00:04:36.781
Ili kubadilisha jinsi programu inavyofanya kazi, gusa Zaidi, kisha Mipangilio.

43
00:04:36.781 --> 00:04:40.371
Hapa unaweza kuwasha au kuzima hali ya giza,

44
00:04:40.371 --> 00:04:42.310
kukuza maandishi,

45
00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:48.844
kubadilisha lugha ya programu, na kuwasha arifa za simu, ili usikose ujumbe wowote.

46
00:04:48.844 --> 00:04:51.986
Kitufe cha kutoka kiko chini kabisa.

47
00:04:52.536 --> 00:04:57.913
Ili kutazama mwongozo huu tena, gusa Zaidi, kisha Jinsi ya kutumia.

48
00:04:57.913 --> 00:05:05.222
Uko tayari. Karibu WODDI Institute. Hakuna mwanamke anayeachwa nyuma.

